         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Practicing Addition with Typed Values\n\nIn this game, you solve a vertical addition by typing the values, from the units to the hundreds.\n\n- Type the digit that stays in the column in the box on the result row.\n- When the sum reaches ten, type 1 in the carry box above the next order.\n\nThe squares show the digit already in the column and how many squares are still missing to reach ten.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
