         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Practice Exercise\n\nReading about addition helps, but practice is essential for real understanding.\n\nBefore typing, check the complement of the digit already in the column:\n\n- At least the complement: the sum reaches ten and carries 1; the squares outside the group show the digit that stays.\n- Below the complement: the sum stays below ten and no 1 is carried.\n- Wrong digit: the squares are colored and a tip reminds you of the complement.\n- Both values right: the squares fill in and the button to the next column appears.\n\nClick the button below to move to the next problem.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
